OL,3,GNEWSASpider bite left man in agony in
OL,4,Ahospital for four days
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man spent four days in hospital after
OL,7,Fa suspected spider bite led to a
OL,8,Fpainful infection in his leg.
OL,10,FGlenn Priestley, from Blackpool, was
OL,11,Frenovating his mother's house in the
OL,12,FMarton area when he picked up a blanket
OL,13,Fand felt what seemed to be a sharp
OL,14,Finsect bite on his left leg.
OL,16,FThe 73-year-old was at a loss as to
OL,17,Fwhat had bitten him but shortly
OL,18,Fafterwards he saw a medium-sized brown
OL,19,Fspider climbing up a wall.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
